dialogues = Array[String](["Brad, Brad Boileux, report for duty.", "Hello, this is Brad?", "What's your rank sailor.", "I just started as a Stateroom Attendant.", "Congratulations sailor, you're the lowest rank on the ship.", "Normally I'd motivate you with a demotion…", "Let's just say I'll throw you overboard if you break the rules.", "Ok understood.", "Now let's get that butt in gear. We have a murdered passenger.", "The guests are restricted to their rooms while we confirm the passenger manifest.", "Go to room 401, and confirm Darryl Critchaw is on-board.", "Yes, I will do that.", "On the double sailor, don't let me down."])
